as a healthy pre-restart state, acknowledged restart, observed interruption, changed boot identity corroborated by lifecycle snapshots, and recovered service, data, credentials, and remote role behavior.","limitations":["Auditor write denial was exercised directly against stock rather than supplier_costs; however, the captured SELECT-only grants, non-elevated role attributes, and successful post-restart checks coherently support read-only access to both tables."]}
